  "title": "Mission Produce® to Promote Year-round Avocado Programs and Highlight Mexico Supply at AFL",
  "summary": "Mission Produce, Inc. (NASDAQ: AVO) (“Mission” or “the Company”) a world leader in sourcing, producing, and distributing fresh Hass avocados, today announced it will showcase its year-round avocado programs and highlight Mexico’s upcoming supply at Asia Fruit Logistica (AFL) in Hong Kong, China, from Sept. 3-5, 2025.",
